
"smart_sources:2026-07-15 - Victor City Council appoints new mayor following Frohlich's resignation.md": {"path":"2026-07-15 - Victor City Council appoints new mayor following Frohlich's resignation.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1prb7kh","at":1785795033691},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1784220982432,"size":8696,"at":1785795033742,"hash":"1prb7kh"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,64]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Rett Nelson","target":"Rett Nelson","line":5},{"title":"NEW MAYOR","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/news/politics/","line":10},{"title":"On July 8, the Victor City Council voted unanimously to appoint Councilmember Sue Mancaster as the new mayor. Previous Mayor Will Frohlich resigned on July 1.","target":"https://s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/assets.eastidahonews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/muncaster-pic.jpg","line":12,"embedded":true},{"title":"in a July 10 news release","target":"https://victoridaho.gov/news/for-immediate-releasejuly-10-2026","line":20},{"title":"RELATED | Victor mayor resigns amid heated recall fight","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/06/victor-mayor-resigns-amid-heated-recall-fight/","line":24},{"title":"filed a lawsuit against Driggs","target":"https://victoridaho.gov/wwtf","line":32},{"title":"RELATED | Driggs in ‘hot water’ as City of Victor sues for alleged wastewater pollution violations","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/06/driggs-in-hot-water-as-city-of-victor-sues-for-alleged-wastewater-pollution-violations/","line":34},{"title":"Under Idaho law","target":"https://ballotpedia.org/Article_VIII,_Idaho_Constitution","line":38},{"title":"Idaho law requires","target":"https://law.justia.com/codes/idaho/title-34/chapter-17/section-34-1702/","line":42},{"title":"Victor Mayor Will Frohlich is resigning, effective July 1. It's tied to a recall election petition over a longtime wastewater dispute with the city of Driggs. | Courtesy City of Victor","target":"https://s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/assets.eastidahonews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/will-frohlich-pic.jpg","line":44,"embedded":true},{"title":"announcing his resignation","target":"https://library.municode.com/id/victor/munidocs/munidocs?nodeId=93ad3018adb9d","line":48},{"title":"SUBMIT A CORRECTION","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/submit-a-correction/?headline=Victor%20City%20Council%20appoints%20new%20mayor%20following%20Frohlich%E2%80%99s%20resignation&url=https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/07/victor-city-council-appoints-new-mayor-following-frohlichs-resignation/","line":62},{"title":"Click here","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/eastidahonews-com-code-of-ethics/#onlinecommenting","line":64}],"metadata":{"title":"Victor City Council appoints new mayor following Frohlich's resignation","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/07/victor-city-council-appoints-new-mayor-following-frohlichs-resignation/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=idaho-officials-support-state-grizzly-managment-yellowstone-s-oldest-pack-exits-park-church-conference-leaves-idaho&_bhlid=6352083f0fecaf3d4392c582806cfaa4e0bd976b","author":["[[Rett Nelson]]"],"published":"2026-07-15","created":"2026-07-16","description":"VICTOR — Days after Victor Mayor Will Frohlich resigned, a new mayor has been appointed in his stead. On July 8, the Victor City Council appointed Councilmember Sue Muncaster to serve the remainder of Frohlich’s term, which expires in 2027. EastIdahoNews.com was unable to reach Mancaster for comment, but in a July 10 news release […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},